{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方两行超大标题首先吸引视线，先看到紫色“那些气不该忍”，紧接着看到蓝色“没了力气”。两行字号、亮度和位置都很突出，形成两个并列的视觉入口。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个人似乎已经没了力气，但具体遭遇了什么、正处于什么处境，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"无力、疲惫，带着不甘和不愿再忍的意味。\",\n  \"missed\": \"委屈和火气都在，还想替自己争口气；柔和的歌声却像被压力推着走，表达这件事不能就这样算了。这些具体处境以及压力与不甘之间的关系，需要读下方两行说明才能获得。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块同样显眼的大字争夺主视线，第一块表达态度，第二块表达状态，两者之间的关系没有直接呈现。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在标题和下方说明中，需要拼接才能理解这个人为什么没了力气，以及委屈、愤怒和压力之间的关系。\",\n    \"放大的“没了力气”能直接传达状态，但单独不能说明具体处境。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8ef232de-5b95-4015-ac3e-b7b3411044f5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T021841050934Z", "elapsed_seconds": 23.218, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:19:04.274115+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9db2346bcc248b8305db25288c8c0e49aab15822d918d34689e0eec679a4d027", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a